OL,3,GNEWSAJuror dismissed as deliberations
OL,4,Aresume at Noah Donohoe inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the jury at the Noah
OL,7,FDonohoe inquest has been discharged.
OL,9,FThe decision was announced on Monday by
OL,10,Fthe coroner Mr Justice Rooney. The
OL,11,Freason has not been made public.
OL,13,FThe inquest has been examining
OL,14,F14-year-old Noah's disappearance and
OL,15,Fdeath in north Belfast in June 2020.
OL,17,FThe jury - now seven men and two women
OL,18,F- has resumed deliberations in the case
OL,19,Fafter the summer recess.
